    "reviews": "\u201cI didn\u2019t feel hungry, because this game is an addiction - it reminds me of what happened when I played Mechabellum and AC6. This could squeak in as game of the year for me, or at least top 5\u2026 This is a good game. This is a very good game.\u201d<br>Aliasbot<br>",
